{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serving up a special sauce for you to add some fun bonus flavors to an already delicious soup, i.e, the main game. Make it easier! Or harder! Or more immersive! Or just give yourself a jump that would make Superman proud. Unlock your inner editor with three new modes to enjoy (or re-enjoy), plus a bunch of toggles, sliders and options you can twiddle and flip to your heart's content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/e8cf29b931e9040deaadc7a850a3f5d8.poster.avif?t=1759159258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/e8cf29b931e9040deaadc7a850a3f5d8.webm?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/e8cf29b931e9040deaadc7a850a3f5d8.mp4?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game the way grandpa intended. No excessive communication. No hints. No help. Just play the game and figure it out yourself. Stop crying like a baby!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/93dae737d42ab90f5eebd37c925ff76e.poster.avif?t=1759159258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/93dae737d42ab90f5eebd37c925ff76e.webm?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/93dae737d42ab90f5eebd37c925ff76e.mp4?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old Game Minus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode is hardddddd. Limited lives. Time tracked. Lose all your lives and we will delete your save. Seriously, we will. Suck it up, buttercup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/fdeb677227d433f681b95b96ff85b9d0.poster.avif?t=1759159258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/fdeb677227d433f681b95b96ff85b9d0.webm?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/fdeb677227d433f681b95b96ff85b9d0.mp4?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mess with seven new categories of customization, including Combat, Survival, Movement, World, HUD, Mission and Progression. Each is filled to the brim with modifiers you control. These thirty new flavors give you a smorgasbord of options to tinker with to create your own gameplay, including adjusting Gravity, Speed, Difficulty, Jump Height, Damage and Infinite Resources (just to name a few).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/51e9c24de98ae32247d20ce4eb59ba4d.poster.avif?t=1759159258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/51e9c24de98ae32247d20ce4eb59ba4d.webm?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/51e9c24de98ae32247d20ce4eb59ba4d.mp4?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spice Up Your Character With New Customization Options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three new color schemes can be utilized in the character customization tool. The purple-headed Kaiju deluxe is the latest addition to the extensive catalog of completely random yet completely appropriate character skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/a26d2ea7eca3f49017cd3dffd95e40fd.poster.avif?t=1759159258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/a26d2ea7eca3f49017cd3dffd95e40fd.webm?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/a26d2ea7eca3f49017cd3dffd95e40fd.mp4?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986890?t=1759159258","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986890?t=1759159258","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/16c7dd554eb3ee6f5eb0949dca9ce455c10a2880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759159258","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/16c7dd554eb3ee6f5eb0949dca9ce455c10a2880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759159258","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serving up a special sauce for you to add some fun bonus flavors to an already delicious soup, i.e, the main game. Make it easier! Or harder! Or more immersive! Or just give yourself a jump that would make Superman proud. Unlock your inner editor with three new modes to enjoy (or re-enjoy), plus a bunch of toggles, sliders and options you can twiddle and flip to your heart's content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/e8cf29b931e9040deaadc7a850a3f5d8.poster.avif?t=1759159258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/e8cf29b931e9040deaadc7a850a3f5d8.webm?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/e8cf29b931e9040deaadc7a850a3f5d8.mp4?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game the way grandpa intended. No excessive communication. No hints. No help. Just play the game and figure it out yourself. Stop crying like a baby!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/93dae737d42ab90f5eebd37c925ff76e.poster.avif?t=1759159258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986890/extras/93dae737d42ab90f5eebd37c925ff76e.webm?t=1759159258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst